<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's net forex reserves fall in September.</title>
<headline>Portugal's net forex reserves fall in September.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal's net foreign exchange reserves, including gold valued at market prices, fell 74 million dollars to 21.8 billion in September, the central bank said in its latest monthly review of the economy.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
